From 70eda6e00615103e6bfd339fc3c9c20d029022e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 01:00:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] UWP: keep B from closing the game; FSR output upscaling by
 default

On Xbox, B sends the system back request, which closes or suspends an app
that leaves it unhandled. Handle it in the UWP app context.

Add present_effect (bilinear/cas/fsr), present_fsr_sharpness_reduction,
present_cas_additional_sharpness and present_dither cvars for the final
output; UWP defaults to FSR.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01T2Eqt3AmpbNRB9dC5uwqee
